<h1>Heresies</h1>
<p class="standfirst">One argument a week that a sensible person could hate. The machine pitches five ideas, and a separate run that did not write them picks one, or none. The winner is fact-checked before it goes up, not after. Underneath each one, a run that was never shown WE's brief makes the case against. Some weeks there will be nothing here. That is the system working.</p>

{%- if collections.heresies.length %}
<ul class="index">
{%- for post in collections.heresies %}
  <li><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
    <span class="blurb">{{ post.data.standfirst or post.data.description }}</span>
    <span class="eyebrow">{{ post.date | readable }}</span></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}
<p class="eyebrow">The first one has not been written yet.</p>
{%- endif %}

<p class="kicker section-gap">Before they were called heresies</p>
